Subject: Cantor B1 Public Verifying Key Revocation Snapshot Verification P0 Data Design

@ [design_uuid] 12e6fbdd-6d62-45dd-a11c-f615f748e9f8

& [Forms]
  + snapshot payload carries identity lineage target policy key status assertion sequence prior digest declared interval optional revocation fields responder class fixture flag and self digest
  + snapshot envelope carries payload explicit responder Ed25519 public key signature fixed context and self digest
  + request carries exact prior A2 evidence current packet A3 raw bytes input class evidence references bounded execution policy and self digest
  + receipt carries input and derived digests nine correspondence booleans three mutually exclusive status projections twenty-four false authority booleans zero-effect account and self digest
  + evidence manifest binds twelve payload artifacts in one exact thirteen-file directory and requires two deterministic plus two fresh-process replays

& [Ordering]
  + raw hash before parse then predecessor packet then A1 then A2 then current packet twice then A3 then receipt then evidence reconstruction

& [Bounds]
  + each form and snapshot at most 1048576 bytes evidence at most 16777216 depth 32 fields 4096 text 8192 references one through forty-eight checked arithmetic throughout
